INSERT INTO questions (category, sub_category, title, question_text, tables_json, options, correct_answer, explanation, difficulty, status, originality_note, passage_group_id) VALUES ('gab_english', '長文読解', 'The History of Quarantine', '次の文章を読み、設問の内容が本文から見て「正しい」「間違っている」「どちらとも言えない」のいずれであるかを判断しなさい。

Long before the discovery of microorganisms as the cause of infectious disease, various societies had developed the practice of quarantine, isolating individuals suspected of carrying contagious illness in an effort to prevent its spread to the broader population. The term itself derives from the Italian phrase for "forty days," reflecting the period during which ships arriving in 14th-century Venice were required to remain anchored offshore before passengers and crew were permitted to disembark, a measure implemented in response to repeated outbreaks of bubonic plague. Although the specific duration of forty days was based more on prevailing religious and astrological beliefs than on precise medical understanding of disease transmission, the underlying practice proved reasonably effective at reducing the spread of certain infectious diseases with known incubation periods. Modern public health authorities continue to rely on quarantine and isolation measures during disease outbreaks, though contemporary approaches are typically informed by scientific understanding of a specific pathogen''s incubation period and mode of transmission rather than a fixed, universally applied duration. Debates over the appropriate balance between public health protection and individual civil liberties during quarantine measures have persisted throughout history and remain relevant today.

【設問】
The word "quarantine" derives from an Italian phrase referring to a period of forty days.', NULL, '["本文の内容から明らかに正しい、または正しい内容が含まれている", "本文の内容から明らかに間違っている、または間違った内容が含まれている", "本文の内容からは、正しいか間違っているか判断できない"]', 0, '["設問は「The word \"quarantine\" derives from an Italian phrase referring to a period of forty days.」という内容である。本文に、この語がイタリア語の『40日間』という語句に由来するとある。よってAとなる。"]', 4, 'published', 'ユーザー提供のオリジナル問題（GAB: 英語/長文読解）', 9448);
